
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#123b52">
<title>Brighton Marathon 2027 | 3:15 Plan</title>
<style>
:root{--navy:#123b52;--blue:#28718a;--bg:#f2f6f8;--line:#dbe5e9;--green:#25805b}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:#1b2930;font:16px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}
header{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#123b52,#28718a);color:white;padding:25px 17px}
header h1{font-size:26px;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 8px}
header p{margin:4px 0}
main{max-width:850px;margin:auto;padding:14px}
.card{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:15px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:14px}
h2{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 12px}
.small{font-size:13px;color:#61717a}
select,button{font:inherit;border-radius:10px;padding:11px;border:1px solid #c6d5dc;width:100%}
select{background:white}
button{background:var(--navy);color:white;font-weight:650;border:0;cursor:pointer}
button.secondary{background:#edf4f6;color:var(--navy);border:1px solid var(--line)}
.controls,.actions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}
.progress{height:9px;background:#e3ecef;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;margin:10px 0}
#bar{height:100%;width:0;background:var(--green)}
.weekhead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start}
.target{font-weight:bold;color:var(--blue);text-align:right}
.day{display:grid;grid-template-columns:25px 1fr;gap:9px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.day input{width:21px;height:21px;margin:2px 0 0;accent-color:var(--green)}
.dayname{font-size:14px;font-weight:750;color:var(--navy)}
.day.done .detail{text-decoration:line-through;color:#77858b}
.detail{margin-top:3px}
.tag{font-size:12px;color:#64747b;margin-top:2px}
.pacerow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:8px 0}
.pacerow:last-child{border:0}
.pacerow span:last-child{text-align:right}
.notice{background:#fff7e8;border:1px solid #f0d7a4;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;font-size:14px}
.actions{margin-top:10px}
footer{text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#64747b;padding:15px}
@media(min-width:650px){main{padding:22px}.days{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 18px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h1>Brighton Marathon 2027</h1>
<p>22-week training planner · Sunday 4 April 2027</p>
<p><strong>Goal: 3:15:00 · Marathon pace: 4:37/km</strong></p>
</header>
<main>
<section class="card">
<h2>Your training progress</h2>
<div class="progress"><div id="bar"></div></div>
<p id="progressText" class="small">0 sessions completed</p>
<div class="controls">
<label><span class="small">Select week</span><select id="week"></select></label>
<label><span class="small">Quick navigation</span><button class="secondary" id="current">Current week</button></label>
</div>
<div class="actions">
<button id="export">Export progress</button>
<button class="secondary" id="import">Import backup</button>
</div>
<input type="file" id="file" accept=".json,application/json" hidden>
<p class="small">Completed sessions save in this browser on this device. Export a backup before changing phones or browsers.</p>
</section>

<section class="card">
<h2>Pace guide</h2>
<div class="pacerow"><strong>Recovery</strong><span>5:45–6:20/km or slower</span></div>
<div class="pacerow"><strong>Easy</strong><span>5:25–6:10/km</span></div>
<div class="pacerow"><strong>Steady</strong><span>5:00–5:25/km</span></div>
<div class="pacerow"><strong>Marathon pace</strong><span>4:37/km</span></div>
<div class="pacerow"><strong>Threshold</strong><span>Initially 4:25–4:35/km</span></div>
<div class="pacerow"><strong>10 km effort</strong><span>About 4:05–4:15/km</span></div>
<p class="small">Use effort, conditions and recovery to guide your pace. These are starting ranges, not compulsory targets.</p>
</section>

<section id="plan"></section>

<section class="card">
<h2>Strength, recovery and fuelling</h2>
<p><strong>Strength A — Monday:</strong> 20–30 minutes of controlled single-leg work, calf raises, glute/hip exercises and trunk stability.</p>
<p><strong>Strength B — Friday:</strong> 15–25 minutes of lighter posterior-chain, calf and core exercises. Avoid heavy lifting that leaves your legs sore for Sunday.</p>
<p><strong>Long runs:</strong> Practise your race-day carbohydrate, fluid and gel plan. Test everything in training.</p>
<div class="notice"><strong>Important:</strong> This is a guide, not a requirement to run seven days every week. Take optional rest days, do not make up missed mileage, and reduce training if fatigue or pain accumulates. Stop if pain changes your running stride. Weekly totals are approximate; individual day distances can be adjusted.</div>
</section>
</main>
<footer>Brighton Marathon · 4 April 2027 · Personal training planner</footer>

<script>
const weeks = [
